Version 4.3.0.

Changelog: 18-11-2026 01:11:04

Added. clear() in applog: an app's log file emptied while it stays in use, and the older ones kept beside it
removed. ActionTab: several of them may stand in one row of tabs (PPSSPP Manager's Clear logs beside Start
game); a tab that acts is never the page another one goes back to. InfoButton: opens, a function the app sets to
open a link in the text itself.

Changelog: 17-11-2026 14:53:56

Version 4.2.0.

